<title>CANADA: Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain east.</title>
<headline>Canada's Prairies to see sun west, rain east.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canada's Prairies on Friday were forecast to see sun west, rain in the east, Environment Canada said.</p>
<p>Alberta should see sunny skies except for showers in the northeast with highs of 17 to 27 Celsius.</p>
<p>Saskatchewan should see showers except for sun in the southwest with highs of 20 to 28 Celsius.</p>
<p>Manitoba should see showers with highs of 20 to 26 Celsius.</p>
<p>((Gilbert Le Gras, Winnipeg Reuters bureau 204 947 3548))</p>
